    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://cropontology.org/rdf/Computation"/>
    <ns1:definition xml:lang="en">Measure distance between the panicle neck node of the main culm and the panicle base, i.e. uppermost culm node. Repeat measurement on other representative plants and take the average.</ns1:definition>
