      </ns2:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <ns1:definition xml:lang="en">1/ oven dry the harvested grains to constant dry weight. 2/ Derive the grain yield from the panicle density, the 1000-grain weight, the number of filled spikelets per panicle or spikelets per panicle and filled spikelet percentage</ns1:definition>
  </ns2:Class>
